    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35a806bae8d6b873430db0ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……長距離レースに重きを置き、\nスタミナの多さを主軸に据えた、\nメジロの伝統ある戦術。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2a16ebf10e9a22e247a9f65daf39d27593ea63e6c3fb0702c0a8cd08de3bcb4",
